      "value": "And just incase anyone finds this post and needs a fix for their broken GetButtonDown/Up code, you can simply do something like this\n\nprivate bool myBool;\n\nprivate void Update()\n\n{\n\n    if (Input.GetButton(\"myButton\"))\n\n    {\n\n        //GetButton code goes here\n\n        if (!myBool)\n\n        {\n\n            myBool = true;\n\n            //GetButtonDown code goes here\n\n        }\n\n    }\n\n    else\n\n    {\n\n        if (myBool)\n\n        {\n\n            myBool = false;\n\n            //GetButtonUp code goes here\n\n        }\n\n    }\n\n}",
      "viewerReactions": null,
